description:
MoneyLover is a powerful yet simple app for managing your personal finance, i.e. your income, cash, spending, expenses, all conveniently from your mobile device. 

With MoneyLover app, you can easily monitor your spending within your planned budget and control your savings by spending reminders and alerts. MoneyLover will act like a financial calendar, alerts you to debts, and reminds you of recording your expenses. All are done in one simple app with a clean and sleek environment.

Functionality: 

- Easy and quick to add transactions, with pictures attached for later reminder;
- Report and Analysis of your incomes, expenses and savings: charts, stats and automatically calculated spending trends;
- Upcoming Cloud feature offers a solution to your pooled funds and synchronizes your expense data from different platforms, perfect for family and household budget managing;
- Travel mode assists you to manage your trip;
- Recurring Transactions tool frees you from repetitive
